# GraphDB: interfaces/ package + Delta de-prefix (backend structure unification)

## Context
Follow-up to the cloisonnement + de-prefix work. The seven backend ABCs were
loose modules at the `graphdb/` root and the `_starter_kit/` was a copy-paste
template rather than a contract; Delta still carried its `Delta` prefix while
Lakebase/Neo4j were already de-prefixed. Goal: one home for the contract and a
uniform capability file set across the three backend folders. Spec:
`docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-02-graphdb-interfaces-package-and-structure-unification-design.md`.

## Changes
1. `src/back/core/graphdb/interfaces/` — renamed from `_starter_kit/`; deleted
   `ExampleStore.py` and `README.md`. Moved the seven contracts here:
   `GraphBackend`, `MaterializedGraphBackend`, `VirtualBackend`, `GraphBuilder`,
   `GraphHealthProbe`, `GraphProvisioner`, `GraphSimulation`. New `__init__.py`
   re-exports them.
2. `src/back/core/graphdb/__init__.py` — dropped the ABC re-exports (kept
   `GraphDBFactory`, `get_graphdb`, constants). Every caller now imports from
   `back.core.graphdb.interfaces` (incl. `reasoning/swrl/SWRLEngine.py`); no shim.
3. Delta de-prefix: `DeltaBase→Base`, `DeltaReadStore→ReadStore`,
   `DeltaMaterializedStore→MaterializedStore`, `DeltaViewStore→ViewStore`,
   `DeltaGraphBuilder→Builder`, `DeltaHealthProbe→HealthProbe`,
   `DeltaSimulation→Simulation`, `DeltaOverviewStats→OverviewStats`,
   `DeltaTripleStoreBuildPipeline→BuildPipeline`. Each backend now presents the
   same capability files (`Builder`/`HealthProbe`/`Simulation`, plus
   `Provisioner` for lakebase/neo4j; Delta has none by design).
4. Collisions where one module imports two backends' same-named class are
   aliased (`… as DeltaBuilder` / `… as LakebaseHealthProbe`) in
   `tests/units/graphdb/test_backend_hats_and_capabilities.py`.
5. `tests/units/architecture/baseline.json` — relocated the moved/renamed keys
   (same LOC values); ratchet confirms shrink-only.
6. Docs: `docs/backend.md` Engine-integration section rewritten around
   `interfaces/` (new "5. Implementing the interfaces" folding the old
   starter-kit README: hat choice + capability table + import boundary);
   `docs/architecture.md` references updated; `docs/diagrams/class-hierarchy.mmd`
   updated (backend-qualified concrete nodes) and `class-hierarchy.png`
   regenerated.

## Modified files
- `src/back/core/graphdb/interfaces/**` (moved + new `__init__`)
- `src/back/core/graphdb/__init__.py`, `GraphDBFactory.py`
- `src/back/core/graphdb/delta/**` (9 modules renamed)
- `src/back/core/reasoning/swrl/SWRLEngine.py` + ~70 import sites across `src/`/`tests/`
- `tests/units/architecture/baseline.json`
- `docs/backend.md`, `docs/architecture.md`, `docs/diagrams/class-hierarchy.{mmd,png}`

## Tests
`uv run --frozen pytest -q -m "not scenario"` → **9865 passed, 326 skipped**
(explicit `EXIT=0`). Architecture import-boundary + size-budget + ratchet all green.

